llama.cpp -- ggml-org/llama.cpp
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

MIT License, held by different copyright holders.

`patches/` contains diffs against llama.cpp. Those files carry context lines
from that project, and applying them produces a modified copy of it. Its notice
is kept byte-identical beside them in `patches/LICENSE.llama.cpp` -- copied
rather than retyped, because a licence text edited in transit is worse than
none.

